      "system": {
        "slug": "me-npc-lift-grenade",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>You throw a hybrid tech-biotic device that projects a localized mass-effect lift field on detonation, suspending targets in the air.</p><p>Choose a point within <strong>60 feet</strong>. All creatures in a @Template[burst|distance:15]{15-foot burst} centered on that point must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:resolve(13+@actor.system.details.level.value+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/3))|options:me-power:me-npc-lift-grenade] save against the creature's power DC.</p><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> Unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The target is lifted <strong>5 feet</strong> off the ground and becomes <strong>Off-Guard</strong> until the end of your next turn.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is lifted <strong>10 feet</strong> and becomes <strong>Grabbed</strong> (suspended by the biotic field). The Grabbed condition ends at the start of your next turn or when the target Escapes (DC equals the creature's power DC).</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and the target takes @Damage[(2*(1+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/4)))d6[void]] damage and is <strong>Stunned 1</strong>.</p><p><strong>Recharge</strong> The creature can't use this power again for [[/br 1d4 #Recharge]]{1d4 rounds}.</p><hr/><p><em>NPC version. Its DC is 13 + level + a third of level (the moderate DC for the creature's level), and its damage dice multiply every 4 levels. When a creature rolls the save, the result is applied automatically (see the Auto-Apply Power Effects setting).</em></p>",
